    "message": "Add standardized usage attribution to Application Integration agent skills.\n\n- Add `references/attribution.md` to application-integration-basics,\n  application-integration-authoring, and application-integration-troubleshooting.\n- Add a concise `## Attribution` section to each `SKILL.md` with the attribution\n  tokens and the generated-code guardrail.\n- Add an `attribution_tagged_commands` eval case to each `EVAL.txtpb`.\n- Bump `metadata.version` to 1.0.2.\n\nPiperOrigin-RevId: 1007375037",
